        <item>
            <title>1.0.45</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Subscriptions</strong> now hides senders you've unsubscribed from (use "Show unsubscribed" at the bottom to see them). Right after unsubscribing, <strong>Archive</strong> is highlighted — unsubscribing stops new mail, and Archive clears out what's already in your Inbox.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
